		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>New Zee Packers and Movers:</strong> New Zee Packers and Movers offers GST compliant e-Way bills, IBA-approved Lorry Receipts, and comprehensive IRDAI marine transit insurance to ensure a secure and smooth transit of your belongings.</span></li>
